# Skills (63)

- **Selection**: if MCP is available, use `capabilities` / `skill_search` → `skill_get`. Otherwise use `@.kilo/CAPABILITIES.md` (generated, one-line each) and open **only the chosen** `@.kilo/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (do not read everything).
- **Context budget**: contract ≤500tok / catalog ≤1k / one skill ≤2–4KB / memory top-5.
- Origins and licenses: `.kilo/skills/ATTRIBUTION.md` / `LICENSES/`
- Breakdown: Skills For Real Engineers 25 (MIT) / Kilo 16 (MIT) / OpenDesign 10 (Apache-2.0) / this repo 12 (MIT)

## Not set up (keep off the standard flow)

`to-spec`, `to-tickets`, `triage` (issue tracker). Details: `scripts/readiness.json`.

## Development

`setup-matt-pocock-skills` → `to-spec` → `to-tickets` → `implement` / `implement-spec` (`tdd`) → `code-review` → `retro`. When unsure, `ask-matt`.

## Design (web/app UI)

`design-brief` → `reference-design-contract` → `design-md` → `frontend-design` → `design-review` → `web-design-guidelines` → `accessibility-audit` → `web-experience-design`. Generate images with an available image tool (not bundled).

## Market / business planning

`research` → `research-decision-room` → `product-discovery` → `marketing-psychology` → `plan-md`. Brand: `brand-guidelines`. Decks: `slides` (`/deck`).

## Legal / safety

`compliance-legal` → `privacy-review` → `security-review` → `release-readiness`. **Legal calls require human approval.**

## Memory / versioning

`memory` (persist decisions and gotchas / `docs/memory/`) · `changelog` (git log → CHANGELOG, SemVer).

## Quality / operations

`architecture-decision`, `engineering-quality`, `test-engineering`, `performance-audit`, `database-change-safety`, `dependency-upgrade`, `incident-debugging`, `deployment`, `pdca-cycle`.

## Cautions

- **Do not harvest en masse** (only what you need).
- The 3 Marketplace "business" items are **third-party source with unverified licenses** (verify before redistribution).
